  "question": {
    "text": "The pressure and volume of an ideal gas are related as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi></math> (Constant). The work done when the gas is taken from state <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> to state <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ZkHN5",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "YYc4k",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "5tfHj",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nVGbf",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msqrt><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msqrt><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo></math> constant, work done by the gas is given by, </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Here <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, therefore we can write</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> </p>",
    "image": null
  },
